_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Shield_Spikes\" title=\"Shield Spikes\">Shield Spikes</a>:</b> This effect causes this shield to do an extra 4d6 Piercing damage when it is used to shield bash.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Greater_Thorn_Guard\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Greater Thorn Guard\">Greater Thorn&#32;Guard</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Greater_Thorn_Guard\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Greater Thorn Guard\">Greater Thorn&#32;Guard</a>:</b> This armor stings those that attack the wearer, causing 2d6 piercing damage on a successful melee attack.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Shield_Bashing\" title=\"Shield Bashing\"> Shield Bashing +15%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Shield_Bashing\" title=\"Shield Bashing\"> Shield Bashing +15%</a>:</b> +15% Enhancement bonus to your chance of a Secondary Shield Bash. This stacks with bonuses granted by any relevant feats.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Heroism_(enchantment)\" title=\"Heroism (enchantment)\">Greater Heroism</a><span cla